    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/9a94202b3f9c3bc20c400e6ca612f3f6.poster.avif?t=1711023590\" width=606 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/9a94202b3f9c3bc20c400e6ca612f3f6.webm?t=1711023590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/9a94202b3f9c3bc20c400e6ca612f3f6.mp4?t=1711023590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The nasty geese have raided the duck village and it's your time to take revenge!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP</h2>Overcome various obstacles in a series of platformer challenges. Wether it's jumping across fire, making your way through caves or bouncing on mushroom trampolines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/f675931585a61921a1c5d653f15d76b8.avif?t=1711023590\" width=604 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOOT</h2>If you can't get through it, shoot it! Different enemies stand between you and the evil geese. <br>Take them down before they take you down!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/8913864453dcb45ef0feb034bd1cf45f.avif?t=1711023590\" width=604 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT</h2>Gather a lot of goodies like <i>clothing</i>, <i>blueprints</i>, <i>toast </i>and <i>fellow ducks </i>in a retro-like collectathon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/3f213d0436ba928f41fa38784b454f7a.avif?t=1711023590\" width=604 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND MOST IMPORTANTLY...</h2>quack<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/9a94202b3f9c3bc20c400e6ca612f3f6.poster.avif?t=1711023590\" width=606 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/9a94202b3f9c3bc20c400e6ca612f3f6.webm?t=1711023590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/9a94202b3f9c3bc20c400e6ca612f3f6.mp4?t=1711023590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The nasty geese have raided the duck village and it's your time to take revenge!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP</h2>Overcome various obstacles in a series of platformer challenges. Wether it's jumping across fire, making your way through caves or bouncing on mushroom trampolines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/f675931585a61921a1c5d653f15d76b8.avif?t=1711023590\" width=604 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOOT</h2>If you can't get through it, shoot it! Different enemies stand between you and the evil geese. <br>Take them down before they take you down!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/8913864453dcb45ef0feb034bd1cf45f.avif?t=1711023590\" width=604 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT</h2>Gather a lot of goodies like <i>clothing</i>, <i>blueprints</i>, <i>toast </i>and <i>fellow ducks </i>in a retro-like collectathon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692160/extras/3f213d0436ba928f41fa38784b454f7a.avif?t=1711023590\" width=604 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND MOST IMPORTANTLY...</h2>quack<br><br>",
